WEBVTT

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:09.210
Hey, Hino-cha...

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:10.660
An engagement?

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:11.850
Today?

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:14.650
It's so sudden...

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:18.620
Me and Yunoki-sempai?

00:01:58.070 --> 00:02:01.090
Capriccio for a Young Girl's Heart

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:06.020
Let's go home, Hino-san.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.030
Wait!

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.300
Wait!

00:02:15.940 --> 00:02:18.910
Big trouble!

00:02:18.910 --> 00:02:22.330
Yunoki and Hino-chan are gonna get married!

00:02:23.550 --> 00:02:25.790
Or was it engaged?

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:31.590
Yeah, a light color like this works best on you...

00:02:31.590 --> 00:02:35.550
Or maybe we should try a stronger color on top of it?

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:39.210
Yunoki-sempai...

00:02:39.210 --> 00:02:41.630
OK, now try this on.

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:44.790
I don't mind just wearing my uniform.

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:47.350
These clothes are expensive.

00:02:49.570 --> 00:02:51.070
I mind.

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:57.190
Be quiet and be treated like a princess.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:04.900
Are you nervous?

00:03:04.900 --> 00:03:06.830
Yunoki-sempai?

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:09.180
That's not right, is it?

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:10.410
Kahoko...

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:15.880
Azuma-san...

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:19.290
All right then.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:26.220
They've been after me to introduce you since around the second selection.

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:29.120
Who?

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:30.430
Ayano.

00:03:30.430 --> 00:03:31.390
Ayano?

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:34.650
A candidate for my engagement.

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:38.960
Engagement... I mean, candidate?

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:43.000
And um... who do they want to meet?

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:50.230
Actually, she's been so persistent lately that I just told her off without thinking about it.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:56.120
"I can't marry you because there's already a person I love."

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:01.350
The house will be empty today.

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:04.070
"We should help each other out when we're in trouble."

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:06.230
Right, Hino?

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:08.230
No...

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:11.230
Kahoko.

00:04:15.200 --> 00:04:18.990
Well, it is a problem that you're not up to the task...

00:04:20.050 --> 00:04:23.970
If you were more, oh, cute, or smarter... something like that,

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:27.240
it would be more believable.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:30.680
Sorry, I'm just a plain old person!

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:33.360
I'm not saying it's a bad thing.

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:35.450
Why am I here too?

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:37.850
It's too late for that now, Tsukimori.

00:04:37.850 --> 00:04:40.050
But doesn't it worry you all?

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:42.000
It has nothing to do with me.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:45.640
You know... well, since we're here it can't be helped.

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:48.260
This is just because of what you said earlier.

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:51.960
Practicing every second you can?

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:53.510
You're pretty studious...

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:56.270
Or maybe you're just trying to make up for the fact that you suck.

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:00.430
So you're saying it's my fault?

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:02.850
Who else's fault could it be?

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:07.770
I should've asked her back then...

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:13.410
But when did those two get so close?

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:16.420
So, are we going in?

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.150
What should we do?

00:05:21.970 --> 00:05:25.310
Will you press the doorbell?

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:29.680
Is my brother here?

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.580
Oh, Miyabi.

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:32.820
Welcome home.

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:37.570
Brother?

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.820
Is that Yunoki-sempai's sister?

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:42.010
She's really cute!

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:44.750
Brother, who is this?

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.210
Kahoko Hino-san.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:48.730
She's a sophomore.

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:51.660
Hello. Nice to meet you.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.140
Hello.

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:55.150
I'm his younger sister, Miyabi.

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:57.710
Sorry to make you go through all this.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:01.160
I've heard what's going on today.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:03.510
And... I know.

00:06:03.510 --> 00:06:07.630
That he doesn't have anybody he likes.

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:12.140
What are you two whispering about?

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.840
Nothing.

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:17.360
And brother, why haven't you gotten any tea for Kahoko-san?

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.400
Excuse us.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:25.430
Here's some tea.

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:31.040
So?

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:35.620
Um, well... we met Miyabi-chan in front of the gate.

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:37.680
Wait, I mean, what's going on here?

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:41.530
M-m-m-m-m-marriage?

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:45.740
Hihara-sempai was saying something about you being engaged.

00:06:45.740 --> 00:06:49.140
It's nothing as big as that.

00:06:49.140 --> 00:06:51.430
I just asked her help with something.

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:52.560
Right?

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:54.210
Y-Yeah.

00:06:54.210 --> 00:06:57.100
You've come all the way here, why don't you relax?

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:02.240
Oh, Miyabi, would you explain to everyone what's going on here.

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:03.570
Sure.

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:07.580
Can you come with me, Hino-san?

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:12.630
What a pain.

00:07:12.630 --> 00:07:14.880
Did you say something to Hihara?

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.190
Well, whatever.

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:20.460
It'll be fine... even with those four there.

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:23.120
Anyway, she'll be here soon.

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:24.420
Don't screw up.

00:07:26.380 --> 00:07:31.580
Hey... don't come all this way and then say you can't do it.

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:34.530
But is this really OK?

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:37.230
She's gotten to the point of being a candidate for your engagement...

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:41.150
and you're lying and telling her you already have somebody you like.

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:44.660
It's... well it's not just between you two, is it?

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:48.610
It's not a lie at all.

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:51.050
I told you already, right?

00:07:51.050 --> 00:07:52.950
She's just a candidate for my engagement.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:55.510
Simply one among several.

00:07:55.510 --> 00:07:57.620
I have somebody else I like.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:02.100
My grandmother likes her too, so it's almost entirely settled on her.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:07.430
Is that the person that you've decided you're in love with?

00:08:07.890 --> 00:08:10.870
It's nothing as big as that.

00:08:10.870 --> 00:08:13.760
I'm just saying that's she's one of the best choices.

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:21.190
If I can only have one, I should get rid of the more annoying, tedious ones first.

00:08:21.190 --> 00:08:23.730
"Annoying and tedious"? That's mean!

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:25.730
Don't get so angry.

00:08:26.580 --> 00:08:30.460
You should notice already.

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:36.030
Brother, Ayano-san is here.

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.910
OK, let's go.

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:40.670
"Notice"?

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:43.500
Notice what?

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:50.990
Well, good luck.

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:52.290
In a lot of ways.

00:08:54.810 --> 00:08:56.280
Excuse me.

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:09.940
She's different than Miyabi but she's also really cute!

00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:12.230
Azuma-sama?

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:22.560
Even if you already have a person you love, this means nothing to me.

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:26.540
I am prepared at all times to be wed to you.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:28.770
My heart and soul...

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:30.240
Ayano-chan?

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:34.090
Hot and heavy!

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:48.750
Good afternoon.

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:52.820
My name is Ayano Takashina.

00:09:52.820 --> 00:09:57.030
She's the daughter of the president of one of Yunoki's family's business clients.

00:09:57.730 --> 00:10:00.580
She's one year younger than you, Kahoko.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:02.230
Hi there.

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:06.360
I'm Kahoko Hino...

00:10:04.780 --> 00:10:06.360
She's losing, isn't she?

00:10:06.360 --> 00:10:08.000
Totally.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.490
Yeah.

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:14.250
I don't think that that's entirely true, perhaps, in a way...

00:10:15.020 --> 00:10:16.680
Sorry.

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:19.630
Anyway, do you know that girl?

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:20.530
Yes.

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:22.120
She goes to my academy.

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:25.090
I go to the middle school and she goes to the high school.

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:27.560
She's very pretty, and from a nice family...

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.310
And pretty smart.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:30.640
But...

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:34.770
Kahoko-san, I'll say this as clearly as I can.

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:36.040
Here it comes!

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:38.350
Allow me the privilege of being his wife!

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:39.120
Huh?

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:47.260
In exchange, I won't say anything no matter how many mistresses he has!

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:51.450
But she has a problem with running off into her own little world...

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:56.620
By the way, what do you like about Azuma-sama?

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:57.820
Huh?

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:00.630
What do I like?

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:03.420
You're annoying.

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:06.300
Who would everyone believe?

00:11:06.900 --> 00:11:09.260
I hate idiots.

00:11:09.260 --> 00:11:11.720
Um... he's actually a complete jerk.

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:16.000
She's embarrassed easily; I don't think she could answer that.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.820
I see.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:22.540
Um, Ayano-san, um... what do you like about Azuma-san?

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:25.240
Everything.

00:11:25.920 --> 00:11:29.490
I first fell in love with him when I was ten.

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:33.990
Are you OK?

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:37.150
Have something to drink and calm down.

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:40.020
An expression like that ruins your beauty.

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:42.830
And he was in elementary school?

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:45.670
I felt fate just then.

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:47.810
I still do!

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:49.510
And yet...

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:57.430
Azuma-san, what do you like about Kahoko-san?

00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:58.640
I...

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:02.390
No, please don't ask that!

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:05.050
Let me see...

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:23.000
How she's always so dedicated to everything she does.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.960
I wish I was like that.

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:29.360
I know it's a lie, but...

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:36.190
I'm not good enough?

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:52.200
Brother, big trouble!

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:54.590
Grandmother is back!

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:56.460
This is bad news indeed.

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:07.650
Is it that bad if we meet her?

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:10.960
I've heard she's rather strict.

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:14.700
But I need to say hello to her...

00:13:15.430 --> 00:13:17.150
Ayano?

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.430
Azuma-sama...

00:13:19.390 --> 00:13:20.960
Ayano-chan?

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:23.860
What are you doing? It's noisy.

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:29.830
You are... the young lady of the Takashina family?

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:30.800
Yes.

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:32.040
It has been a while.

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.390
Um, Grandmother, Ayano-san is...

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:35.210
Miyabi!

00:13:35.210 --> 00:13:38.770
Why are you still wearing your uniform?

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:40.370
Go change.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:42.760
Yes, ma'am.

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.250
I'm sorry.

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:45.860
By the way...

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:47.700
What brings you here?

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:55.200
I can't say I approve of a girl your age visiting alone when the adults of the house are away.

00:13:57.450 --> 00:13:59.440
Um...

00:13:59.950 --> 00:14:02.570
Grandmother, there's no real...

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:03.970
Silence.

00:14:03.970 --> 00:14:07.760
No matter the reason, refrain from private relationships.

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:09.170
Especially you, Ayano-san.

00:14:10.400 --> 00:14:15.830
You should refrain from actions that will invite misunderstandings by your peers.

00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:20.750
Hey, that's a bit much, isn't it?

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:25.680
I'm terribly... sorry.

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:32.960
Anyway, please leave.

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:34.760
She's not alone.

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:36.420
We were with her.

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:40.760
I'm Yunoki-sempai's junior at Seiso Academy, and today... um...

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:43.850
Geez, she needs to think things through.

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:47.570
We all met here to talk about the contest...

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:49.880
Right, Hihara-sempai.

00:14:49.880 --> 00:14:53.820
Y-Yeah. Yunoki's place is huge, so it's perfect for meetings.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:56.980
Then why didn't you say so?

00:14:56.980 --> 00:15:01.590
Participating in the competition is fine, but remember that your priority is schoolwork.

00:15:01.590 --> 00:15:03.560
Understood?

00:15:03.560 --> 00:15:07.020
Above all else, you must not damage the reputation of the Yunoki family.

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:12.470
Your reputation affects that of your brothers as well.

00:15:13.460 --> 00:15:16.530
Don't worry, Grandmother.

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:20.800
I always make sure to avoid causing any trouble for you.

00:15:20.800 --> 00:15:29.200
Yunoki-sempai... is that why... you're always smiling, and always so nice to everyone?

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:31.870
Yunoki-sempai is...

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:34.760
very popular at school.

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:41.750
He's popular among both the boys and girls, and very good with the flute; everyone looks up to him.

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:44.700
And he's really seriously participating in the contest...

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:52.840
Grandmother, you may think that it's a just a school contest, but it's a very high-level, serious thing.

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:57.920
So please stop treating them so unkindly.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:07.610
Anyway, it's late, please have them leave.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:10.100
Yes.

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:13.570
I'm terribly sorry...

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:16.780
It was my fault for running out there...

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:23.280
I'm sorry.

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:25.070
It's a lie.

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:28.680
There's nothing between me and Yunoki-sempai.

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.980
I'm really sorry.

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:34.890
You even felt the need to lie...

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:41.220
Am I... am I that bothersome to you?

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:43.550
No, that's not it.

00:16:43.550 --> 00:16:45.510
It's not, Ayano-chan.

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:51.320
It's not that it's a problem, or anything, but that you're looking at things, and I'm worried about you.

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:52.690
No!

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:56.050
I'm have eyes for you, Azuma-sama...

00:16:56.050 --> 00:16:57.280
That's not it.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:03.500
We're still both students, and you've just gotten to high school.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:10.650
You need to absorb a lot more, meet many more people, and polish yourself...

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:15.470
Things like this can wait until after that.

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:19.920
Yeah, that's right.

00:17:19.920 --> 00:17:25.660
And don't say stupid things like "I don't care how many mistresses you have."

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:27.910
You know that's not true.

00:17:28.490 --> 00:17:33.940
Because, well... you want the person you love to only be looking at you.

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:37.920
Y-Yes...

00:17:39.930 --> 00:17:44.680
Well, as a man, it kind of makes me sad to be thought of that way.

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:47.430
Yeah, that's right. It's impossible.

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:48.890
Right, you two?

00:17:48.890 --> 00:17:49.950
Well...

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:53.380
I couldn't handle that many.

00:17:56.420 --> 00:18:01.120
Azuma-sama... I'll do my best from here on out.

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:07.950
So can I still like you?

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:16.040
That was pretty smart of you, Yunoki-sempai.

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:19.410
There's nothing else I could've said then, is there?

00:18:19.410 --> 00:18:22.300
Ayano-chan's pretty cute, wasn't she?

00:18:22.300 --> 00:18:24.760
More like pretty annoying.

00:18:24.760 --> 00:18:25.960
You're a horrible person.

00:18:25.960 --> 00:18:31.920
Well, that girl's just getting started... this is the best way.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:35.740
"That girl"... you sound like an old man.

00:18:35.740 --> 00:18:38.850
It's the same for you, isn't it, Yunoki-sempai?

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:47.550
Or maybe you just have bad luck with women?

00:18:47.550 --> 00:18:49.280
Including you?

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:52.780
Why me, too?

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:55.320
I'm kidding.

00:18:56.760 --> 00:18:59.030
Yunoki-sempai's smile.

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:00.840
It's gentle.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:04.170
You annoy me.

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:07.910
Which is the real you?

00:19:08.880 --> 00:19:12.860
Is your usual smile fake?

00:19:12.860 --> 00:19:15.130
Is that what you're worried about?

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:21.230
Kreisler's lies ended up teaching many people about the wonders of music.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:25.100
What about your lies, Yunoki-sempai?

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:27.910
Hiding your true self...

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:30.470
Deceiving the people around you...

00:19:30.470 --> 00:19:33.900
Doesn't it hurt, Sempai?

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:40.520
"Sempai"? You're acting like you're the same.

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:49.130
Anybody who's tricked by those, it's their own fault.

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:49.950
But...

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:53.070
Hino, we're going home.

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:56.160
See, they're calling you.

00:19:56.660 --> 00:19:58.340
Goodbye.

00:19:59.430 --> 00:20:01.890
Thank you, Kahoko.

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:09.560
Was he making fun of me?

00:20:21.740 --> 00:20:23.870
Man, I'm hungry.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.270
Want to get some ramen?

00:20:25.270 --> 00:20:27.070
Huh? At this hour?

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:05.770
Ryotaro?

00:21:06.880 --> 00:21:08.500
It's been a while.

00:21:09.570 --> 00:21:10.920
Sakimoto?

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:15.050
Seiso Academy's clothes look great on you.

00:21:15.050 --> 00:21:17.270
What are you doing here?

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:19.450
I was over at a friend's place.

00:21:19.450 --> 00:21:24.140
Oh come on, don't look like that just because you ran into an old girlfriend.

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:31.810
Are you his new girlfriend?

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:35.140
His new... his girlfriend?

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:37.700
What are you saying?

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:39.740
You're not?

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:42.280
Oh man, I'm sorry!

00:21:43.350 --> 00:21:46.120
So are you that guy's girlfriend?

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:49.950
N-No...

00:21:51.160 --> 00:21:53.530
Oh geez, I was wrong again?

00:21:53.530 --> 00:21:55.500
I'm so sorry.

00:23:36.380 --> 00:23:39.790
Lili's One Point Classic!

00:23:39.790 --> 00:23:42.850
Beethoven's famous for having a serious-looking face,

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:47.910
but he actually had many romances, and would dedicate songs to the girls he loved.

00:23:49.680 --> 00:23:53.800
For instance, the piano piece "The Moonlight Sonata" was

00:23:53.800 --> 00:23:58.250
dedicated to a girl named Julietta fourteen years his junior when he was thirty-one.

00:23:58.250 --> 00:24:00.160
OK, now time for a quiz.

00:24:00.160 --> 00:24:05.140
What famous song did he make for woman named Therese?

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:08.800
What?  Hihara-sempai and Tsuchiura-kun are going to have a contest?

00:24:09.070 --> 00:24:09.910
Why?

00:24:09.910 --> 00:24:11.730
That's what I want to know.

00:24:11.730 --> 00:24:14.300
Maybe a cake-eating contest or something?

00:24:14.760 --> 00:24:17.200
Next episode: Aria of a Pounding Heart.

00:24:17.200 --> 00:24:20.100
Tsuchiura, I knew you had a girlfriend!

00:24:20.620 --> 00:24:25.090
The answer is... "Fur Elise!"
